00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,020
in it within weeks.

302
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,920
Without you pressing anything.

303
00:08:18,230 --> 00:08:19,810
A United States senator put

304
00:08:19,850 --> 00:08:20,940
that worry in a letter

305
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:21,980
to the company:

306
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:23,560
retirement money that may

307
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,520
have to buy,

308
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,780
whatever the price.

309
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:27,960
So buy, or don't.

310
00:08:28,150 --> 00:08:30,120
A piece may find you either way.

311
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:32,040
And it comes without a say.

312
00:08:33,230 --> 00:08:35,140
But look at who else has none.

313
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,960
Even Amazon and Google,

314
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,560
which each own a large slice

315
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,270
of this company,

316
00:08:39,310 --> 00:08:41,530
hold shares with no vote at all.

317
00:08:41,950 --> 00:08:43,600
As this company is built today,

318
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,430
the wheel is not for sale.

319
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,800
At any price.

320
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:48,310
That's the hopeful part.

321
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:49,630
The hard part:

322
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:51,840
it rests with eleven people.

323
00:08:52,010 --> 00:08:53,200
Seven founders.

324
00:08:53,290 --> 00:08:54,380
Four trustees.

325
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,020
The same dinner table.

326
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,350
But the board they

327
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:58,910
choose is bound,

328
00:08:58,950 --> 00:09:00,590
by the company's legal form,

329
00:09:00,660 --> 00:09:02,170
to weigh three things.

330
00:09:02,510 --> 00:09:03,870
The shareholders' money.

331
00:09:04,190 --> 00:09:06,180
The company's stated purpose.

332
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,070
And the interests of everyone

333
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:09,390
materially affected by

334
00:09:09,430 --> 00:09:10,490
what it does.

335
00:09:11,110 --> 00:09:12,370
Now recall the warning

336
00:09:12,410 --> 00:09:13,430
in the document.

337
00:09:13,670 --> 00:09:15,460
Risks to humanity.

338
00:09:15,930 --> 00:09:16,770
Who is materially

339
00:09:16,810 --> 00:09:18,010
affected by that?

340
00:09:18,350 --> 00:09:19,330
You are.

341
00:09:19,370 --> 00:09:21,260
With a share, or without.

342
00:09:22,590 --> 00:09:24,530
You can buy a piece of AI.

343
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:26,460
You can't buy a say in it.

344
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,570
But you never needed

345
00:09:27,610 --> 00:09:29,440
a share to have a stake.

346
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:32,100
And a stake has a voice.

347
00:09:32,330 --> 00:09:34,040
A senator used hers.

348
00:09:34,290 --> 00:09:35,200
A city's pension

349
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,820
watchdog used his.

350
00:09:37,110 --> 00:09:38,940
And now there is a public record

351
00:09:38,980 --> 00:09:41,230
to hold up when you use yours.

352
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:43,280
A share has a price.

353
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,000
A stake never did.

354
00:09:46,110 --> 00:09:47,180
This channel exists

355
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:48,440
for one reason:

356
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,470
so that the arrival

357
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:50,560
of superintelligence

358
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,280
goes well for everybody.

359
00:09:52,620 --> 00:09:54,070
For the few who hold a share,

360
00:09:54,110 --> 00:09:56,250
and the billions who hold a stake.

361
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,580
Want that too?

362
00:09:57,650 --> 00:09:58,650
Then subscribe.

